  "$bash_note": "Bash(*) added (most recent rebuild, 2026-09): multi-command foundation/gate scripts never match single-program patterns, so every compound Bash call prompted. The deny list (force-push, --no-verify, hard reset, rm -rf, publish/--live, pr merge) is evaluated first and still blocks. `rm -rf` is denied outright: the gate scripts' own temp cleanup runs inside `sh .claude/scripts/...`, which the pattern does not match."
